            "review_title": "Review at Old town coffee",
            "review_text": "RYAN B\n7 contributions\n1\nNice food for me, not for my partner\nApr 2018 • Couples\nDecided to pop in after a long walk, it is a beautiful place. Was going well until we ordered food. My partner ordered noodles without meat (she's a vegetarian), it was not on the menu be like every other place in Vietnam we presumed they could cook it without. Unfortunately it arrived with meat and after telling the staff they simply returned it to the kitchen counter, picked the meat out and returned it. The meal still had meat in and by this point my partner did not want the meal at all so we left it on the side, the staff, instead of dealing with it, laughed and left it there. While my meal was rather nice (pork and rice), it was hard not to feel abit dissapointed by the poor service. To top it off, they tried to bill us for my partners meal after all. Although I understand we are in Vietnam and should speak their language, it should not be too difficult to communicate 'No beef'.\nRead more\nWritten April 24, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
