            "review_title": "Review at Old town coffee",
            "review_text": "Emma J\nPill, United Kingdom2 contributions\n0\nNot Veggie friendly\nApr 2018\nThere are no vegetarian options on this menu, which would not be a problem as all restaurant we have been to so far offer to make the dish meat free. However when I ordered the dish, it came with beef. We sent it back, reminding the waiter that we ordered meat free. We then watched as the cook picked out the beef with his hands, and brought it back, as all the staff laughed at the situation. There was still beef left in the dish. We communicated clearly that I can not eat meat and that it makes me ill. They were just annoyed that we were not happy. I took the dish back to the kitchen with the beef sat on the side of the plate and there has been no attempt to rectify the issue. So I got to sit and watch my partner eating his food. \nThen then tried to charge us for the meal!\nRead more\nWritten April 24, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
